@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

###############################################
# LOGIN FALSO DO APP MOBILE (sem token, só o e-mail)
###############################################

### Aluno existe (200). Devolve id, nome, email e personalId
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marcos@exemplo.com"
}

### Espaços e maiúsculas são normalizados (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "  Marcos@Exemplo.com "
}

### Aluno não existe (404): "Aluno não encontrado"
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ninguem@exemplo.com"
}

### E-mail inválido (400): erro de validação do DTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abc"
}

### Sem corpo (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/app/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}
